OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMostly dry at first, but rain
OL,6,Fwill soon spread in from the west,
OL,7,Fbecoming widespread, persistent and
OL,8,Flocally heavy, especially over higher
OL,9,Fground. Conditions should gradually
OL,10,Fturn drier later in the afternoon as
OL,11,Fthe rain clears away.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRemaining cloudy with further
OL,14,Foutbreaks of rain, frequent over
OL,15,Fhigher ground. Becoming breezy
OL,16,Fovernight, with the rain gradually
OL,17,Feasing and conditions turning drier by
OL,18,Fthe end of the night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
