OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FDry and brighter at first
OL,6,Fwith some sunny spells. Cloud soon
OL,7,Fthickening from the west, bringing
OL,8,Foutbreaks of rain during the
OL,9,Fafternoon, becoming persistent through
OL,10,Fthe evening. Remaining breezy.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRain
OL,13,Fclearing to sunny spells and blustery
OL,14,Fshowers on Friday. Largely dry on
OL,15,FSaturday, with lighter winds and sunny
OL,16,Fspells. Changeable, windy and wet on
OL,17,FSunday. Temperatures near average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
